+# Goal acceptance and revision accountability
+
+| Human requirement | Outcome and location | Verification / remaining limit |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| Make the outstanding CIA and FAA work a goal | New PROTOCOL.md and goal scope | Bounded to supplied continuation and12FAA records; not the separate16task programme |
+| Verify CIA continuation | CC001–CC003; source pages92–93 and dated aid | Report-derived access/possible reliance/paper route qualified; originals remain open |
+| Verify every FAA record | FA001–FA012 in findings.json and REPORT.md | All12incoming IDs retained; no unsupported promotion from summary |
+| Preserve conflicting records and counterevidence | Each record’s qualifications; source excerpts; unchanged incoming findings | No preferred historical value; no native clock reconstruction |
+| Check audio method | Independent all-zero PCM/output/hash/repetition census | Failed method preserved;0accepted words or wall-clock anchors; no rerun/upload |
+| Preserve exact citations and sources | SOURCES.json / EXCERPT-PINS.json / retained native originals | Physical/printed pages and derivative lines distinguished; mirror/raw gaps explicit |
+| Pursue missing originals | Eight-query SEARCH-LOG and7target sets;9CIA groups carried | Bounded public search, no outreach or false claim of exhaustive search |
+| Integrate without duplicate counting | M161–M175 added to160exact prior objects | Dependency/overlap and method-counterevidence types explicit |
+| Preserve prior documents and deliver text diff | New dated edition, TEXT-CHANGES.diff, source-candidate file manifest | Earlier reports unchanged; additive/new-file diff separate from PDF visual checks |
+| Commit/push as AveLyra | Verified account/remote/new commit metadata; post-push receipt separately | No private push, raw media export, history rewrite or PR merge |
+| Keep navigation changes reviewable | Existing-file update via PR | No automatic merge |
+
+All prior BR/BPR/CIAQ unresolved questions remain preserved in the master and preceding studies. No final disciplinary disposition, exact alarm-data loss cause, native-WAV conversion chain or original CIA recipient receipt was obtained. Those limits are carried forward rather than erased to declare historical completion.
