+2 The Commission staff also identified two other inaccura te statements made by the NORAD Colonel at the 
+May 23, 2003, hearing.  Because those statements involved acti ons by DOD officials, not  FAA officials, they 
+were investigated by DOD/OIG. 
+ 
+Report No. CC-2006-085 
